SUMMARY:UnRuffle yo’self at Otter Hole
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nI am going to unravel my stress at Otter Ho
 le Swimmin’ Hole at the headwaters of the So.Mills River.\nOtter Hole is
  a small cascade dropping into a deep swimmin’ hole near the headwaters 
 of the south fork of Mills River that flow out of Pink Beds watershed. We 
 will pass some lovely rock walls\, dripping and oozing water. We also pass
  some nice cascades and pools.\nDifficulty: Forested single track moderate
  descent\, ‘natural’ surface w/ rocks & roots.\nThe cold water of Otte
 r Hole is suitable for deep water swimmin’ or floating.\nWe are the **Sl
 oth Hike Team of WNC**: “We will get there when we get there.”\n**http
 s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQ8H4EK2vt4**\nUp to 12 ppl are welcome to joi
 n me.\nI will spend (up to) 2-3 hours at the falls. Come prepared to prete
 nd to meditate\, ponderin’\, practice your Tai-Chi\, **森林浴**\, rea
 d a book\, prepare a meal\, play a flute or swim.\n**Hike Details:**\nSoci
 al ‘hour’ at 9:50am. Bus leaves at 10:00a)\nLength: 3.0mi RT\; Accum a
 scent: 350 ft\; most on the return. Pace: **1.5mph.**\n**[Optional: Furthe
 r down the trail is Billy Branch Falls (add 1 mi RT)]**\n**Drive time: 30m
 in/12 mi 1-way**\n**Apprx return time: 2:30 PM (=4.25hrs)**\n**Carpool con
 tributions appreciated. $2.00 suggested**\n**THIS IS A DOG-PARTICIPANT HIK
 E.** This event is NOT for those who are uncomfortable with the antics of 
 fun-loving dogs. Well trained dogs (you don’t have to yell.) can be 'off
 -leash'. 'On leash' during the Unraveling (‘cept for swimmin’). Small 
 (lap)dogs may carpool. Large dogs will drive themselves.\nWeather Check: B
 revard\, NC\nWAITLISTED PEOPLE WILL BE ADDED AS DRIVERS SIGN ON.\nI curren
 tly have 2.5 driver. (=10ppl)\nWe suggest masks and open windows while car
 pooling. Only you know your own health status so judge accordingly if an e
 vent may endanger your health or the health of others.\nPlease bring an ex
 tra pair of shoes to avoid bringing your muddy shoes into the driver's car
  at the end of the hike.\nIncessant prattlers will be assumed to be having
  an affair. Obstreperous raucous yawping is discouraged.\n**UnRuffle/UnRav
 el:** To experience a time of quiet in a manner that you feel worthwhile. 
 Démêlez votre stress.\nEngage the 5 senses (sight\, smell\, touch\, tast
 e\, hearing)\,\nObserve the movement of the forest & water.\nBreathe the a
 roma of the air\, water\, plants and forest.\nFeel the texture of the air\
 , water\, trees and plants.\nListening to the sound of air\, water\, critt
 ers & birds\;\nTaste the air of the breezes or soothing snacks.\nAll hikes
  are at your own risk. You are responsible for your OWN safety and adequat
 e equipment.\nWaiver: The organizer of this event is a volunteer and not a
  professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize thi
 s event. There are certain risks inherent in any outdoor activity. Each pa
 rticipant\, by signing up to attend this event\, agrees to release from li
 ability the leader(s)\, Hendo Fun Friends\, its Partners\, Affiliates\, an
 d members for any accident\, injury\, illness\, or personal loss which mig
 ht occur while participating in this activity or while traveling in any ve
 hicle during this trip. **Each participant further agrees to abide by the 
 rules and regulations concerning safety\, to follow instructions of the le
 ader(s)\, and not to become intentionally separated from the group.** The 
 leader(s) also has the right to use any images collected on this trip for 
 recording on website photo collections.\ngordie's contact: curmudgeonhiker
 @gmail.com\n(**before** day of hike): 828.393.0297 (talk & text)\n**Pics: 
 https://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/albums**
