SUMMARY:Monte’s Sub Shop Lunch
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nWe will meet at ***Monte’s Sub Shop for a
  late lunch.***\n2024 Asheville Hwy\, Hendersonville\n**A limit of 16 ppl 
 are welcome to join me.**\nPlease keep your RSVP’s current. (I need to l
 et them know how many we got !)\nWe will meet inside\, order and find our 
 table in the back room.\nI will NOT join tables together. We will share mu
 ltiple tables.\nSubs\, Hoagies\, Grinders\, Heroes... whatever you call th
 em\, this is the place FOR them in Hendersonville\, NC!\nLocally owned by 
 Monique and Dan Ruiz\nhttp://www.montessubshop.com/\nhttp://www.montessubs
 hop.com/menu/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/MontesSubShop\nMon-Fri-11am-7pm\nS
 at-11am-4pm\nSun-Closed
