SUMMARY:FYI: Rockin’ on the Rock
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**FYI: Rockin’ on the Rock**\nSept 12\, &
  October 9\, 2026\n5pm / Free\nJump Off Rock\, Laurel Park\, NC\nEnjoy liv
 e music at the picturesque Jump Off Rock\, which overlooks the French Broa
 d River valley and the Blue Ridge Mountains beyond. Musical offerings rang
 ing from jazz to country\, rockabilly\, pop\, rock and blues. Organized by
  the Friends of Laurel Park.\nSep 12\; 5:00 pm\; Rockin’ on the Rock wit
 h **Showboat Band**\nOct 9\; 5:00 pm\; Rockin’ on the Rock with Autumnwo
 od\nJump Off Rock\; 4433 Laurel Park Hwy\, Laurel Park\, NC 28739\nhttps:/
 /visithendersonvillenc.org/event/rockin-on-the-rock-with-showboat-band
